sequenceDiagram
    actor Receptionist
    participant Web as Web app
    participant Axios as apiClient
    participant API as API guards and pipe
    participant Svc as PatientsService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Receptionist->>Web: Fill the New Patient form, click Add Patient
    Web->>Axios: createPatient, blank fields removed
    Axios->>API: POST /patients with Bearer token, x-organization-id, x-location-id
    API->>API: JwtAuthGuard checks the access token
    API->>DB: TenantContextGuard checks owner or active assignment at the location
    API->>API: FeatureFlagGuard - no RequireFeature on this route, passes
    API->>DB: AccessGuard resolves AccessContext, needs patients.create
    API->>DB: SubscriptionGuard checks read-only mode for this write
    API->>API: ValidationPipe validates CreatePatientDto
    API->>Svc: create with tenant context, DTO and actor
    Svc->>DB: phone already used in this organization?
    Svc->>DB: count patients to build the patient number
    Svc->>DB: transaction - INSERT patients, INSERT audit_logs, COMMIT
    Svc-->>API: PatientResponseDto
    alt success
        API-->>Axios: 201 envelope isSuccess true, data, message
        Axios-->>Web: response
        Web->>Web: invalidate patients queries, list refetches
        Web-->>Receptionist: Toast Patient created, offer first appointment
    else any error, for example 409 phone exists
        API-->>Axios: GlobalExceptionFilter envelope isSuccess false, message
        Axios-->>Web: rejected promise
        Web-->>Receptionist: Toast with the message
    end
